# Cloud Build upload hygiene — keep only Docker build inputs.
.git/
.cursor/
.terraform/
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.json
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/tfplan*
**/*.tfplan
**/*.log
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
artifacts/
infrastructure/terraform/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/.DS_Store
